@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Ingest the bulletins once before testing chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ingest
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "What is the weather in Chennai and what safety precautions should I take if it rains?",
  "location": {
    "city": "Kolkata"
  },
  "language": "en",
  "channel": "web"
}
